# Rust文件编码规范

## 文件头部结构

### 属性声明
```rust
#![no_std]
#![feature(abi_riscv_interrupt)]
#![allow(unexpected_cfgs, static_mut_refs)]
```

### 宏导入
```rust
#![macro_use]
#![allow(unused)]
```

### 导入顺序
1. 标准库导入
2. 外部crate导入 (按字母序)
3. 当前crate导入 (按模块层级)

示例:
```rust
use core::convert::Infallible;
use core::marker::PhantomData;

use embassy_hal_internal::{impl_peripheral, into_ref, Peripheral};
use embedded_hal::digital::OutputPin;

use crate::{pac, peripherals};
use crate::gpio::{AnyPin, SealedPin};
```

## 错误处理模式

### 错误类型定义
```rust
#[non_exhaustive]
#[derive(Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq, Debug)]
#[cfg_attr(feature = "defmt", derive(defmt::Format))]
pub enum ConfigError {
    /// 具体错误描述
    BaudrateTooLow,
    BaudrateTooHigh,
}
```

### Result类型使用
- 优先使用自定义错误类型
- 对于简单操作可使用 `Infallible`
- 配置错误使用 `ConfigError`
- I/O错误使用 `embedded_io::Error`

## 内存安全模式

### 临界区操作
```rust
critical_section::with(|_| {
    self.pin.set_as_input();
    self.pin.set_pull(pull);
});
```

### 原子操作
```rust
use core::sync::atomic::{AtomicU32, AtomicU8, Ordering};

static WAKER: AtomicWaker = AtomicWaker::new();
```

### 生命周期管理
```rust
pub struct Flex<'d> {
    pub(crate) pin: PeripheralRef<'d, AnyPin>,
}

impl<'d> Flex<'d> {
    pub fn new(pin: impl Peripheral<P = impl Pin> + 'd) -> Self {
        into_ref!(pin);
        Self { pin: pin.map_into() }
    }
}
```

## HAL驱动模式

### 构造函数模式
```rust
impl<'d> UartTx<'d> {
    pub fn new_blocking(
        peri: impl Peripheral<P = impl Instance> + 'd,
        tx: impl Peripheral<P = impl TxPin<T>> + 'd,
        config: Config,
    ) -> Result<Self, ConfigError> {
        into_ref!(peri, tx);
        // 实现逻辑
    }
}
```

### 配置结构体
```rust
#[non_exhaustive]
#[derive(Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq, Debug)]
pub struct Config {
    pub baudrate: u32,
    pub data_bits: DataBits,
    pub stop_bits: StopBits,
    pub parity: Parity,
}

impl Default for Config {
    fn default() -> Self {
        Self {
            baudrate: 115200,
            data_bits: DataBits::DataBits8,
            stop_bits: StopBits::STOP1,
            parity: Parity::ParityNone,
        }
    }
}
```

## 异步编程模式

### Future实现
```rust
use core::future::poll_fn;
use core::task::Poll;

pub async fn wait_for_high(&mut self) {
    poll_fn(move |cx| {
        if self.is_high() {
            Poll::Ready(())
        } else {
            // 注册唤醒器
            WAKER.register(cx.waker());
            Poll::Pending
        }
    }).await
}
```

### 异步/阻塞切换
```rust
use crate::mode::{Async, Blocking, Mode};

pub struct Uart<'d, M: Mode> {
    inner: UartInner<'d>,
    _phantom: PhantomData<M>,
}

impl<'d> Uart<'d, Blocking> {
    pub fn blocking_read(&mut self, buf: &mut [u8]) -> Result<(), Error> {
        // 阻塞实现
    }
}

impl<'d> Uart<'d, Async> {
    pub async fn read(&mut self, buf: &mut [u8]) -> Result<(), Error> {
        // 异步实现
    }
}
```

## 中断处理模式

### 中断绑定
```rust
use crate::bind_interrupts;

bind_interrupts!(struct Irqs {
    UART0 => uart::InterruptHandler<peripherals::UART0>;
    GPIO => gpio::InterruptHandler;
});
```

### 中断处理器实现
```rust
pub struct InterruptHandler<T: Instance> {
    _phantom: PhantomData<T>,
}

impl<T: Instance> interrupt::typelevel::Handler<T::Interrupt> for InterruptHandler<T> {
    unsafe fn on_interrupt() {
        // 中断处理逻辑
        T::Interrupt::steal().complete();
    }
}
```

## 条件编译规范

### 特性检查
```rust
#[cfg(feature = "embassy")]
pub mod embassy;

#[cfg(mcan)]
pub mod mcan;

#[cfg(all(feature = "time", feature = "embassy"))]
use embassy_time::Instant;
```

### 芯片差异处理
```rust
#[cfg(hpm67)]
self.pin.ioc_pad().pad_ctl().modify(|w| w.set_smt(enable));

#[cfg(not(hpm67))]
self.pin.ioc_pad().pad_ctl().modify(|w| w.set_hys(enable));
```

### IP特性处理
```rust
#[cfg(soc_ip_feature = "UART_RX_IDLE_DETECT")]
fn enable_idle_detection(&self) {
    // 实现逻辑
}
```

